# Build context for apps/api/Dockerfile and apps/web/Dockerfile (both build from the repo root). The images install their
# own dependencies and build their own output; installation config and secrets are runtime inputs, never image content.
.git
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/dist
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/e2e-artifacts
**/*.tsbuildinfo
# Secrets and per-installation config (docker/.env, apps/*/.env, .env.test …) — templates stay.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
!**/.env.test.example
# Runtime data (the uploads volume, media-normalization backups, local dev mail) — exact paths: apps/api/src/modules/uploads
# is code and must stay in the context.
apps/api/uploads
apps/api/backups
apps/api/.devmail
